        "title": "CCTV",
        "description": "CCTV app! Requires Picoware v1.7.0+ and users need a word list of CCTV stream URLs in 'picoware/cctv/list.txt' on the device's storage, with one URL per line.\n\nThe app connects to each URL in turn and displays the MJPEG stream.\nUse the UP/DOWN or LEFT/RIGHT buttons to switch between cameras, and BACK to exit.\n\nIn my testing I saw 300kb frames so its possible on the Pico2W and Pimoroni 2W only... although some endpoints may have smaller frames",
